metadata.body:
Adds a cross-cutting commerce change for Daphne PR analysis:

- tenant-scoped checkout idempotency, retry tracking, and payload-conflict rejection;
- API and worker integrations for retryable checkout;
- an order operations dashboard with filtering, status, totals, and responsive styling;
- tenant-scoped order read models and summaries;
- SQL migrations and representative seed data for orders and idempotency records.

The change spans 36 files across UI, business logic, API/worker boundaries, and data definitions so it can exercise semantic grouping and evidence traversal.

Validation: `npm run build`

